{"id":"a5d92ffe99f0a9dfb5cf37c9852752396eb9ae87","axis":"silent","repo":"nuxt/nuxt","sha":"a5d92ffe99f0a9dfb5cf37c9852752396eb9ae87","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"knip.json","lines":["@@ -50,6 +50,12 @@","         \"#shared/*\": [\"./shared/*\"]","       }","     },","+    \"test/fixtures/duplicate-vue\": {","+      \"entry\": [","+        \"**/*.{js,ts,tsx,mjs,mts,vue}!\"","+      ],","+      \"ignoreDependencies\": [\"duplicate-vue-ui\", \"@vue/runtime-core\"]","+    },","     \"test/fixtures/nitro-legacy\": {","       \"entry\": [","         \"**/*.{js,ts,tsx,mjs,mts,vue}!\""],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/kit/src/internal/index.ts","lines":["@@ -32,6 +32,9 @@ export type { ParsedNodeModulePath } from './node-module.ts'"," "," export { hasOwnSubpathImport } from './subpath-imports.ts'"," ","+export { VUE_PACKAGE_NAMES, VUE_PACKAGE_SPECIFIER_RE, isInVuePackages, resolveVuePackageImporter, resolveVuePackages } from './vue-packages.ts'","+export type { VuePackageName, VuePackages } from './vue-packages.ts'","+"," export { resolveModuleExportNames } from './exports.ts'"," export type { ResolveModuleExportNamesOptions } from './exports.ts'"," "],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/kit/src/internal/vue-packages.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,88 @@","+import { readFileSync, realpathSync } from 'node:fs'","+import { dirname, join } from 'pathe'","+import { resolveModulePath } from 'exsolve'","+import type { Nuxt } from '@nuxt/schema'","+","+/** Each Vue runtime package, and the package it is resolved from. */","+const VUE_PACKAGE_PARENTS = {","+  'vue': undefined,","+  '@vue/runtime-dom': 'vue',","+  '@vue/runtime-vapor': 'vue',","+  '@vue/server-renderer': 'vue',","+  '@vue/shared': 'vue',","+  '@vue/runtime-core': '@vue/runtime-dom',","+  '@vue/reactivity': '@vue/runtime-core',","+} as const","+","+export type VuePackageName = keyof typeof VUE_PACKAGE_PARENTS","+","+export const VUE_PACKAGE_NAMES = Object.keys(VUE_PACKAGE_PARENTS) as VuePackageName[]","+","+/** Matches an import of a Vue runtime package, or of one of its subpaths. */","+export const VUE_PACKAGE_SPECIFIER_RE = /^(vue|@vue\\/(?:runtime-dom|runtime-vapor|runtime-core|reactivity|shared|server-renderer))(?:\\/|$)/","+","+export interface VuePackages {","+  /** The directory of each Vue runtime package that resolves. */","+  dirs: Partial<Record<VuePackageName, string>>","+  /** The version of `vue`, when it resolves. */","+  version?: string","+}","+","+const vuePackagesCache = new WeakMap<Nuxt, VuePackages>()","+","+/**","+ * The single copy of Vue an app is built with: `vue` as resolved from Nuxt, and each `@vue/*`","+ * runtime package as resolved from the package that depends on it.","+ *","+ * @internal","+ */","+export function resolveVuePackages (nuxt: Nuxt): VuePackages {","+  let packages = vuePackagesCache.get(nuxt)","+  if (!packages) {","+    const dirs: VuePackages['dirs'] = {}","+    for (const [name, parent] of Object.entries(VUE_PACKAGE_PARENTS) as [VuePackageName, VuePackageName | undefined][]) {","+      const from = parent ? dirs[parent] : nuxt.options.appDir","+      const dir = from && resolvePackageDir(name, from)","+      if (dir) {","+        dirs[name] = dir","+      }","+    }","+    packages = { dirs, version: dirs.vue && readVersion(dirs.vue) }","+    vuePackagesCache.set(nuxt, packages)","+  }","+  return packages","+}","+","+/**","+ * A file inside the package `id` is resolved from, so that resolving `id` from it reaches the","+ * resolved copy of Vue, or `undefined` if `id` is not a Vue runtime package that resolves.","+ *","+ * @internal","+ */","+export function resolveVuePackageImporter (packages: VuePackages, id: string): string | undefined {","+  const name = id.match(VUE_PACKAGE_SPECIFIER_RE)?.[1] as VuePackageName | undefined","+  const dir = name && packages.dirs[name]","+  return dir ? join(dir, 'package.json') : undefined","+}","+","+/**","+ * Whether `path` is inside one of the resolved Vue runtime packages.","+ *","+ * @internal","+ */","+export function isInVuePackages (packages: VuePackages, path: string): boolean {","+  return Object.values(packages.dirs).some(dir => path.startsWith(dir + '/'))","+}","+","+function resolvePackageDir (name: string, from: string): string | undefined {","+  const path = resolveModulePath(`${name}/package.json`, { from: from.endsWith('/') ? from : from + '/', try: true })","+  return path ? dirname(realpathSync(path)) : undefined","+}","+","+function readVersion (dir: string): string | undefined {","+  try {","+    return JSON.parse(readFileSync(join(dir, 'package.json'), 'utf8')).version","+  } catch {","+    return undefined","+  }","+}"],"additions":88,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/nuxt/src/core/build-plugins.ts","lines":["@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@"," import { join } from 'pathe'"," import { resolveModulePath } from 'exsolve'"," import { addBuildPlugin } from '@nuxt/kit'","+import { resolveVuePackages } from '@nuxt/kit/internal'"," import type { Unimport } from 'unimport'"," import type { Nuxt } from 'nuxt/schema'"," ","@@ -16,12 +17,24 @@ import { PrehydrateTransformPlugin } from './plugins/prehydrate.ts'"," import { ExtractAsyncDataHandlersPlugin } from './plugins/extract-async-data-handlers.ts'"," import { VirtualFSPlugin } from './plugins/virtual.ts'"," import { BundledVuePlugin } from './plugins/bundled-vue.ts'","+import { VuePackagesBundlerPlugin, VuePackagesPlugin } from './plugins/vue-packages.ts'"," "," /**","  * Register the transforms core Nuxt applies to app code. Those that depend on options modules","  * may still change are registered once modules are done.","  */"," export function addCoreBuildPlugins (nuxt: Nuxt) {","+  const vuePackages = resolveVuePackages(nuxt)","+  addBuildPlugin({","+    vite: () => VuePackagesPlugin(vuePackages),","+    webpack: () => VuePackagesBundlerPlugin(vuePackages),","+    rspack: () => VuePackagesBundlerPlugin(vuePackages),","+  })","+  nuxt.hook('nitro:config', (config) => {","+    config.rollupConfig ||= {}","+    config.rollupConfig.plugins = [VuePackagesPlugin(vuePackages), ...toArray(config.rollupConfig.plugins || [])]","+  })","+","   if (!nuxt.options.dev && !nuxt.options.vue.runtimeCompiler) {","     addBuildPlugin({ vite: () => BundledVuePlugin() }, { client: false })","     nuxt.hook('nitro:config', (config) => {"],"additions":13,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/nuxt/src/core/plugins/vue-packages.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,73 @@","+import { dirname } from 'pathe'","+import { resolveModulePath } from 'exsolve'","+import { VUE_PACKAGE_SPECIFIER_RE, isInVuePackages, resolveVuePackageImporter } from '@nuxt/kit/internal'","+import type { VuePackages } from '@nuxt/kit/internal'","+import type { Plugin } from 'vite'","+","+/**","+ * Resolves every import of a Vue runtime package to the single copy of Vue the app is built","+ * with, wherever the importing file is. Used as both a Vite and a Rolldown plugin.","+ */","+export function VuePackagesPlugin (packages: VuePackages): Plugin {","+  return {","+    name: 'nuxt:vue-packages',","+    enforce: 'pre',","+    resolveId: {","+      order: 'pre',","+      filter: { id: VUE_PACKAGE_SPECIFIER_RE },","+      async handler (id, importer, options) {","+        if (importer && isInVuePackages(packages, importer)) {","+          return","+        }","+        const pinnedImporter = resolveVuePackageImporter(packages, id)","+        if (!pinnedImporter) {","+          return","+        }","+        const resolved = await this.resolve(id, pinnedImporter, { ...options, skipSelf: true })","+        if (!resolved || resolved.external || id === 'vue' || this.environment?.mode !== 'build' || this.environment.config.consumer !== 'server') {","+          return resolved","+        }","+        // a server build that leaves `vue` external has to load the rest of Vue from outside it too","+        const vue = await this.resolve('vue', resolveVuePackageImporter(packages, 'vue'), { skipSelf: true })","+        const path = vue?.external && resolveModulePath(id, { from: pinnedImporter, conditions: ['node', 'import'], try: true })","+        return path ? { id: path, external: 'absolute' } : resolved","+      },","+    },","+  }","+}","+","+interface ResolveData {","+  request: string","+  context: string","+  contextInfo: { issuer: string }","+}","+","+interface Compiler {","+  hooks: {","+    normalModuleFactory: {","+      tap: (name: string, fn: (factory: { hooks: { beforeResolve: { tap: (name: string, fn: (data: ResolveData) => void) => void } } }) => void) => void","+    }","+  }","+}","+","+/**","+ * Resolves every import of a Vue runtime package from the single copy of Vue the app is built","+ * with, wherever the importing file is. Used as both a webpack and an Rspack plugin.","+ */","+export function VuePackagesBundlerPlugin (packages: VuePackages) {","+  return {","+    apply (compiler: Compiler) {","+      compiler.hooks.normalModuleFactory.tap('nuxt:vue-packages', (factory) => {","+        factory.hooks.beforeResolve.tap('nuxt:vue-packages', (data) => {","+          if (!VUE_PACKAGE_SPECIFIER_RE.test(data.request) || (data.contextInfo.issuer && isInVuePackages(packages, data.contextInfo.issuer))) {","+            return","+          }","+          const pinnedImporter = resolveVuePackageImporter(packages, data.request)","+          if (pinnedImporter) {","+            data.context = dirname(pinnedImporter)","+          }","+        })","+      })","+    },","+  }","+}"],"additions":73,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/nuxt/test/vue-packages.test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,105 @@","+import { mkdir, mkdtemp, realpath, rm, symlink, writeFile } from 'node:fs/promises'","+import { tmpdir } from 'node:os'","+import { pathToFileURL } from 'node:url'","+import { afterAll, describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'","+import { dirname, join } from 'pathe'","+import { build } from 'vite'","+import { resolveVuePackages } from '@nuxt/kit/internal'","+","+import { VuePackagesPlugin } from '../src/core/plugins/vue-packages.ts'","+","+const tmpDir = await realpath(await mkdtemp(join(tmpdir(), 'nuxt-vue-packages-')))","+","+afterAll(() => rm(tmpDir, { recursive: true, force: true }))","+","+async function write (path: string, contents: string) {","+  await mkdir(dirname(path), { recursive: true })","+  await writeFile(path, contents)","+}","+","+async function link (target: string, path: string) {","+  await mkdir(dirname(path), { recursive: true })","+  await symlink(target, path, 'junction')","+}","+","+const DEPENDENCIES: Record<string, string | undefined> = {","+  'vue': '@vue/runtime-dom',","+  '@vue/runtime-dom': '@vue/runtime-core',","+  '@vue/runtime-core': '@vue/reactivity',","+  '@vue/reactivity': undefined,","+}","+","+async function writeVue (store: string, version: string) {","+  for (const [name, dependency] of Object.entries(DEPENDENCIES)) {","+    const nodeModules = join(store, `${name.replace('/', '+')}@${version}/node_modules`)","+    const dir = join(nodeModules, name)","+    await write(join(dir, 'package.json'), JSON.stringify({ name, version, type: 'module', exports: { '.': './index.js', './*': './*' } }))","+    await write(join(dir, 'index.js'), dependency","+      ? `export * from '${dependency}'\\nexport const ${name === 'vue' ? 'version' : 'unused'} = '${version}'\\n`","+      : `export const reactivity = '${version}'\\n`)","+    if (dependency) {","+      await link(join(store, `${dependency.replace('/', '+')}@${version}/node_modules`, dependency), join(nodeModules, dependency))","+    }","+  }","+  return join(store, `vue@${version}/node_modules/vue`)","+}","+","+async function createProject () {","+  const rootDir = join(tmpDir, 'project')","+  const store = join(rootDir, 'node_modules/.pnpm')","+  const nuxtDir = join(store, 'nuxt@1.0.0/node_modules/nuxt')","+  const uiDir = join(store, 'ui@1.0.0/node_modules/ui')","+","+  await write(join(rootDir, 'package.json'), JSON.stringify({ name: 'project', type: 'module' }))","+  await write(join(rootDir, 'entry.js'), [","+    'export { version as nuxt } from \\'nuxt\\'',","+    'export { version as ui, reactivity as uiReactivity } from \\'ui\\'',","+  ].join('\\n'))","+","+  await link(await writeVue(store, '1.0.0'), join(store, 'nuxt@1.0.0/node_modules/vue'))","+  await write(join(nuxtDir, 'package.json'), JSON.stringify({ name: 'nuxt', type: 'module', exports: './dist/index.js' }))","+  await write(join(nuxtDir, 'dist/index.js'), 'export { version } from \\'vue\\'\\n')","+  await mkdir(join(nuxtDir, 'dist/app'), { recursive: true })","+  await link(nuxtDir, join(rootDir, 'node_modules/nuxt'))","+","+  // pnpm hoists a second copy that a package without its own dependency on vue resolves","+  await writeVue(store, '2.0.0')","+  await link(join(store, 'vue@2.0.0/node_modules/vue'), join(store, 'node_modules/vue'))","+  await link(join(store, '@vue+reactivity@2.0.0/node_modules/@vue/reactivity'), join(store, 'node_modules/@vue/reactivity'))","+  await write(join(uiDir, 'package.json'), JSON.stringify({ name: 'ui', type: 'module', exports: './index.js' }))","+  await write(join(uiDir, 'index.js'), 'export { version } from \\'vue\\'\\nexport { reactivity } from \\'@vue/reactivity\\'\\n')","+  await link(uiDir, join(rootDir, 'node_modules/ui'))","+","+  const nuxt = { options: { appDir: join(nuxtDir, 'dist/app') } } as Parameters<typeof resolveVuePackages>[0]","+  return { rootDir, packages: resolveVuePackages(nuxt) }","+}","+","+describe('VuePackagesPlugin', async () => {","+  const { rootDir, packages } = await createProject()","+","+  it('resolves vue and its dependencies along the dependency chain', () => {","+    expect(packages.version).toBe('1.0.0')","+    expect(Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(packages.dirs).map(([name, dir]) => [name, dir.slice(rootDir.length)]))).toStrictEqual({","+      'vue': '/node_modules/.pnpm/vue@1.0.0/node_modules/vue',","+      '@vue/runtime-dom': '/node_modules/.pnpm/@vue+runtime-dom@1.0.0/node_modules/@vue/runtime-dom',","+      '@vue/runtime-core': '/node_modules/.pnpm/@vue+runtime-core@1.0.0/node_modules/@vue/runtime-core',","+      '@vue/reactivity': '/node_modules/.pnpm/@vue+reactivity@1.0.0/node_modules/@vue/reactivity',","+    })","+  })","+","+  it('bundles a single copy of vue for the client', async () => {","+    const dir = join(rootDir, 'dist')","+    await build({","+      root: rootDir,","+      configFile: false,","+      logLevel: 'silent',","+      plugins: [VuePackagesPlugin(packages)],","+      build: {","+        outDir: dir,","+        minify: false,","+        lib: { entry: join(rootDir, 'entry.js'), formats: ['es'], fileName: () => 'entry.js' },","+      },","+    })","+    await expect(import(pathToFileURL(join(dir, 'entry.js')).href)).resolves.toMatchObject({ nuxt: '1.0.0', ui: '1.0.0', uiReactivity: '1.0.0' })","+  })","+})"],"additions":105,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/rsbuild/src/config.ts","lines":["@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ import { joinURL, withoutLeadingSlash } from 'ufo'"," import { defineEnv } from 'unenv'"," "," import { resolveAllowedHosts } from '../../webpack/src/utils/same-origin.ts'","-import { getDevtool, getNuxtDefines, getTranspilePatterns, resolveVueAliases } from '../../webpack/src/utils/options.ts'","+import { getDevtool, getNuxtDefines, getTranspilePatterns, resolveVueRouterAlias } from '../../webpack/src/utils/options.ts'"," import { createServerExternals } from '../../webpack/src/utils/server-externals.ts'"," import { getHMRPath } from './dev-server.ts'"," import { DynamicBasePlugin } from './plugins/dynamic-base.ts'","@@ -182,7 +182,7 @@ function clientEnvironment (nuxt: Nuxt, { entry, assetPrefix }: EnvironmentOptio","     },","     resolve: {","       alias: {","-        ...resolveVueAliases(nuxt, false),","+        ...resolveVueRouterAlias(nuxt, false),","         'nitro/runtime-config': nitroClientRuntime,","        